The conceptual source is Ed Fassio's The Constitution of the Frontier:
What Must Remain True, No Matter How Intelligent the Machines Become,
first edition, 2026. The book's decision-scoped Delegation Ladder and human
sponsorship commitments inform the proposed technical representation.
The grant schema, executable monitor, fixtures, and evaluation package are
technical extensions; they are not code or a protocol reproduced from the book.

Generative AI assisted preparation of the implementation, tests, and documentation.
All reported execution results are deterministic synthetic checks, not empirical
validation of organizational governance or production security.

